in="00:47.230" end="00:47.410">on </span><span begin="00:47.410" end="00:47.530">the </span><span begin="00:47.530" end="00:48.970">decline</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.970" end="00:51.460"><span begin="00:48.970" end="00:49.150">And </span><span begin="00:49.150" end="00:49.360">if </span><span begin="00:49.360" end="00:49.540">you </span><span begin="00:49.540" end="00:49.960">really </span><span begin="00:49.960" end="00:50.350">wanna </span><span begin="00:50.350" end="00:50.800">save </span><span begin="00:50.800" end="00:51.040">me </span><span begin="00:51.040" end="00:51.430">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.460" end="00:55.780"><span begin="00:51.460" end="00:51.670">You </span><span begin="00:51.670" end="00:52.120">better </span><span begin="00:52.120" end="00:52.510">bring </span><span begin="00:52.510" end="00:52.750">your </span><span begin="00:52.750" end="00:53.170">guns </span><span begin="00:53.170" end="00:53.770"> </span><span begin="00:53.770" end="00:53.890">and </span><span begin="00:53.890" end="00:53.890">*</span><span begin="00:53.890" end="00:53.890">*</span><span begin="00:53.890" end="00:53.890">*</span><span begin="00:53.890" end="00:53.890">*</span><span begin="00:53.890" end="00:53.890">*</span><span begin="00:53.890" end="00:53.890">*</span><span begin="00:53.890" end="00:53.890">* </span><span begin="00:53.890" end="00:54.280">take </span><span begin="00:54.280" end="00:54.640">me </span><span begin="00:54.640" end="00:55.780">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.780" end="00:58.990"><span begin="00:55.780" end="00:56.290">Cut </span><span begin="00:56.290" end="00:56.590">you </span><span begin="00:56.590" end="00:57.220">open </span><span begin="00:57.220" end="00:57.370">and </span><span begin="00:57.370" end="00:57.850">make </span><span begin="00:57.850" end="00:58.120">you </span><span begin="00:58.120" end="00:58.990">sick</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.990" end="01:02.770"><span begi